Hi Nicholas,

I would recommend exporting your genlight as a fasta file, and then running it in IQtree using the ascertainment bias correction for SNPs. This will give you a publishable phylogenetic tree with individual tips.

Substitution Models <http://www.iqtree.org/doc/Substitution-Models#ascertainment-bias-correction>
iqtree.org <http://www.iqtree.org/doc/Substitution-Models#ascertainment-bias-correction>
 <http://www.iqtree.org/doc/Substitution-Models#ascertainment-bias-correction>

Cheers,

Renee

